@startuml

[*] --> Idle : CardInserted

Idle --> WaitingForPIN : CardInserted
WaitingForPIN --> Verified : PINEntered and PINVerified
Verified --> OptionsAvailable : UserApprovalGiven
OptionsAvailable --> ProcessingWithdrawal : WithdrawalRequestReceived
ProcessingWithdrawal --> DispensedCash : CashDispensed
DispensedCash --> ReceiptPrinted : ReceiptPrinted
ReceiptPrinted --> CardReturned : TransactionCompleted
CardReturned --> Reset : TimeElapsed

Reset --> [*]

@enduml
